 228:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/tcpwm/cy_tcpwm.h **** * The functions and other declarations used in this part of the driver are in cy_tcpwm.h. 
 229:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/tcpwm/cy_tcpwm.h **** * Include either of cy_tcpwm_counter.h, cy_tcpwm_pwm.h, cy_tcpwm_quaddec.h 
 230:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/tcpwm/cy_tcpwm.h **** * depending on the desired functionality. You can also include cy_pdl.h 
